{
  "schema": "jobcrawl-detect-fingerprints-v2",
  "_comment": [
    "Detector v2 fingerprints (core/detect/index.mjs; JOBCRAWLX row 2A.5). One row per source in the provider registry (crawler/providers*.mjs) plus",
    "platforms with no reader yet (provider null: named, not readable). All patterns are case-insensitive JavaScript regexes as strings.",
    "  provider  registry id;  platform  display id when it differs;  kind  ats | site (single-employer reader) | generic | aggregator",
    "  hosts     regexes over a host: the vendor's own hosts (careers URL, redirect target, script/iframe/form/link on one)",
    "  url       regexes over a full URL that put it on this source (board URLs, tenant custom domains)",
    "  cname     regexes over the CNAME target of the careers host",
    "  html      script_src / iframe_src / link_href / meta_generator / jsonld: regexes over that attribute or block; markup: over the raw HTML",
    "  headers   [{ name, pattern }] over response headers;  api  endpoint templates ({slug}) whose appearance in the page is a signal",
    "  slug      rules, first hit wins: {from:url,pattern,group} | {from:detect} (the provider's own detect()) | {from:origin|host|page|ref} | {from:const,value}",
    "  weights   optional per-kind multipliers;  page_refs  false = only the careers URL itself counts (never a link on a page)",
    "Signal weights (top-level \"weights\") combine as 1 - prod(1 - w) over the distinct kinds seen. A site row counts only on the page's own domain.",
    "Seeded 2026-11-28 from every provider detect() regex, crawler/profiler/fingerprints.json (fingerprints-v1) and hand-written embed markers.",
    "Add a source: one row here plus a fixture (core/tests/fixtures/detect/<provider>.html with a \"<!-- expect: provider slug -->\" first line)."
  ],
  "weights": {"url":0.95,"redirect":0.95,"cname":0.9,"iframe_src":0.85,"script_src":0.8,"form_action":0.8,"api":0.75,"meta_generator":0.7,"jsonld":0.7,"header":0.6,"markup":0.6,"link_href":0.6,"inline":0.5},
